          "prompt": "A: I was wondering if you wanted to get together on Saturday?\nB: I’d love to but I can’t. I’m going away for the weekend.\n(love to / but can’t. go away / for the weekend.)"
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "number": 2,
          "input": "text",
          "prompt": "A: Can you give me a hand to set up my new computer?\nB: ______________________________ (sorry / can’t. work late / this evening.)",
